Package: pembropsm
Title: Partitioned Survival Model of First-Line Pembrolizumab in PD-L1 >= 50% NSCLC
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Salvatore", "Barbagallo", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reconstructs individual patient data from published Kaplan-Meier
    curves (KEYNOTE-024, 5-year analysis) and implements a generic three-state
    partitioned survival cost-effectiveness model.
